#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:14
msgid ""
"This notice explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the "
"choices you have when using LetterGator. We designed the service to keep "
"letter content protected while still letting us run the platform, provide "
"delivery, prevent abuse, and support your account."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:24
msgid "1. Information we collect"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:26
msgid ""
"We collect information you provide directly, such as your name, email "
"address, phone number, address, letter content, delivery dates, recipient "
"details, attachments, account notes, and support requests. We also collect "
"technical information such as device data, log data, usage events, and other "
"information needed to keep the platform secure and reliable."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:38
msgid "2. How we use information"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:40
msgid ""
"We use information to create and manage your account, process and deliver "
"letters, verify addresses, send notifications, provide customer support, "
"detect fraud or abuse, improve the product, and comply with legal or "
"accounting obligations. We may also use aggregated or de-identified "
"information for analytics and service improvements."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:52
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "6. Message content and encryption"
msgid "3. Letter content and encryption"
msgstr "6. Հաղորդագրության բովանդակություն և կոդավորում"

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:54
msgid ""
"Letter content is encrypted before it is stored. Decryption is performed "
"only inside controlled application flows when required to render, validate, "
"or deliver a letter. We do not intend for plaintext letter content to be "
"exposed through normal database access alone."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:65
msgid "4. Sharing and disclosure"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:67
msgid ""
"We do not sell your personal information. We may share data with service "
"providers that help us host the application, send email, store backups, "
"process payments, or monitor security. We may also disclose information if "
"required by law, to enforce our terms, or to protect users, our systems, or "
"the public."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:78
msgid "5. Retention and backups"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:80
msgid ""
"We retain account data, letter data, payment records, and support history "
"for as long as reasonably necessary to operate the service, meet legal "
"obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements. Some encrypted "
"data may be backed up or archived to improve durability and recovery options."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:91
msgid "6. Your choices and controls"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:93
msgid ""
"You can update certain profile details in your account, such as your email "
"address, phone number, and address where available. You may also contact us "
"with questions about your data, request help with account access, or ask "
"about deletion options where legally and operationally possible."
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:104
msgid "7. Security"
msgstr ""

#: letters/templates/letters/privacy.html:106
msgid ""
